# Cockroach Janta Party, hand-placed items. Issue #54.
#
# The layer of the corpus that has no historic route. The movement's primary
# social account has no API, aggressive anti-scraping, and archive snapshots
# that are login redirects rather than content, and the platform where the
# account was blocked for part of the period leaves a gap in the account's own
# timeline that the interface cannot be asked about.
#
# Every item here is a post that news coverage quotes with a date, and the
# comment line above it names that coverage. scripts/build_corpus.py refuses an
# item with no citation above it: an item without the reporting it came from is
# a fabricated timestamp inside a corpus whose whole claim is that it
# fabricates none.
#
# published_at_signal is cited_reporting for an item dated by the coverage, and
# archive_capture for one dated by an archive snapshot. Both are weaker claims
# than an outlet's own assertion, and the difference has to stay answerable
# from the row.
#
# Format: docs/corpus_format.md. One JSON object per line, a citation comment
# above each.
